msgstr "<small>Pop-up wordt alleen op de voorpagina getoond.</small>"

#: includes/settings/mybooking-plugin-settings.php:1775
msgctxt "settings_context"
msgid ""
"<b>Activate Testimonials</b> Custom Post Type in order to create a "
"testimonials carousel."
msgstr ""
"<b>Activeer Testimonials</b> Aangepast posttype om een carrousel voor "
"testimonials te maken."

#: includes/settings/mybooking-plugin-settings.php:1778
msgctxt "settings_context"
msgid ""
"<small>Create one or more Testimonials under Mybooking menu and use "
"[mybooking_testimonials] to show it on a page or sidebar.</small>"
msgstr ""
"<small>Maak één of meer Testimonials aan in het Mybooking-menu en gebruik "
"[mybooking_testimonials] om dit op een pagina of in de zijbalk te tonen.</"
"small>"

#: includes/settings/mybooking-plugin-settings.php:1807
msgctxt "settings_context"
msgid ""
"<b>Activate Content Slider</b> Custom Post Type in order to create a content "
"slider with Gutenberg native editor."
msgstr ""
"<b>Activeer de inhoudsschuifregelaar</b> Aangepast berichttype om een "
"content-schuif te maken met de native editor van Gutenberg."

#: includes/settings/mybooking-plugin-settings.php:1810
msgctxt "settings_context"
msgid ""
"<small>Create one or more Sliders under Mybooking menu and use "
"[mybooking_content_slider] to show it on a page or post.</small>"
msgstr ""
"<small>Maak één of meer schuifregelaars aan in het Mybooking-menu en gebruik "
"[mybooking_content_slider] om dit op een pagina of bericht te tonen.</small>"

#: includes/settings/mybooking-plugin-settings.php:1839
msgctxt "settings_context"
msgid ""
"<b>Activate Product Slider</b> Custom Post Type in order to create a content "
"slider to show offers with limited custom fields."
msgstr ""
"<b>Activeer Product Slider</b> Aangepast berichttype om een inhoudsschuif te "
"maken die aanbiedingen toont met beperkte aangepaste velden."

#: includes/settings/mybooking-plugin-settings.php:1842
msgctxt "settings_context"
msgid ""
"<small>Create one or more Product Sliders under Mybooking menu and use "
"[mybooking_product_slider] to show it on a page or post.</small>"
msgstr ""
"<small>Maak één of meer Product Sliders aan onder het Mybooking-menu en "
"gebruik [mybooking_product_slider] om dit op een pagina of bericht te tonen."
"</small>"

#: includes/settings/mybooking-plugin-settings.php:1871
msgctxt "settings_context"
msgid "<b>Activate Cookies Notice</b> in order to create a cookies warning."
msgstr ""
"<b>Activeer Cookie-kennisgeving</b> om een cookiewaarschuwing te creëren."

#: includes/settings/mybooking-plugin-settings.php:1874
msgctxt "settings_context"
msgid ""
"<small>Set the privacy page at WordPress settings to link properly the info "
"button.</small>"
msgstr ""
"<small>Stel de privacypagina in bij de WordPress-instellingen in om de "
"infoknop correct te linken.</small>"

#: includes/settings/mybooking-plugin-settings.php:1905
msgctxt "settings_context"
msgid ""
"Include <b>slickJS</b> library. It is <b>required</b> if you are using the "
"testimonials or slider complement."
msgstr ""
"Voeg <b>de slickJS-bibliotheek</b> op. Het is <b>vereist</b> als je de "
"testimonials of slider-aanvulling gebruikt."

#: includes/settings/mybooking-plugin-settings.php:1908
msgctxt "settings_context"
msgid ""
"<b>¡Attention!</b> Uncheck if not testimonials or slider are used or if the "
"theme that you are using includes slickJS."
msgstr ""
"<b>¡Attentie!</b> Verwijder het vinkje als er geen testimonials of slider "
"worden gebruikt, of als het thema dat je gebruikt slickJS bevat."

#: includes/settings/mybooking-plugin-settings.php:1938
msgctxt "settings_context"
msgid "Use <b>select2</b> library on form selects."
msgstr "Gebruik <b>de select2-bibliotheek</b> op formulierselecties."

